{
    "title": "Language Translator, Translate",
    "description": "\ud83c\udf1f<b>Language Translator, Translate</b>\ud83c\udf1f - No more language barrier! Enjoy and translate any language you want with text translator, voice translator, photo translator,... Our all-language interpreter & translator tools allow you to do an offline translation even if you have no internet connection...\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83c\udf10Main feature of Language Translator, Translate\ud83c\udf10</b>\r\n<b>\u2600\ufe0fDeep translate\u2600\ufe0f</b>\r\n\u2714 Fast, and easy translations between the following languages are supported: translate English to Hindi, Tagalog, Spanish, Arabic, Japanese, Korean, Chinese, German, French, Italian, Dutch, etc. The Language Translator app has +100 languages for your daily translate needs.\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\udccbChat, Text Translator</b>\r\n\u2714 Quick text translate on screen: this function is ready with a tap screen to translate the text you want.\r\n\u2714 Chat translator: Translate all messages that have come to you with an instant language translator. Just click on messages, copy a text, and auto-translate from chat, website with language tool\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udde8\ufe0fPhoto translator</b>\r\n\u2714 Turn your camera into an instant online translator. Take a photo and easily translate images with one tap. Translation text will be rendered directly in the photo with the live camera and image translator feature. Photo translation of the object will allow you to understand everything you see.\r\n\u2714 Your trusted document translator: Point your camera at a document and get instant translation with image translator.\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\udce2Voice translator</b>\r\n\u2714 Become your interpreter to help record sound to transcribe speech to text. Voice-to-voice real time translation is the ideal feature to help you communicate with people around the world or travel, simply talk and Language Translator app will translate for you. Accurate translation of conversation, dialog, etc.\r\n\u2714 Text to speech of the voice translator allows you to understand everything you hear.\r\n\r\n<b>\u2600\ufe0fLearn all languages\u2600\ufe0f</b>\r\n\u2714 Learn multiple languages with this language exchange app: quickly improve vocabulary with this Language Translator - Translate app, which allows easy translation of all languages in parallel and offers English idioms, new phrases, and over 200 topic recognitions, along with vocabulary and sentence exercises for deep memorization and skill enhancement.\r\n\r\nNote\r\nIn instant translator mode, app use Accessibility Service to be able to get screen text.\r\n\r\nContact us: teammarketing@lutech.ltd",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83c\udf1f<b>Language Translator, Translate</b>\ud83c\udf1f - No more language barrier! Enjoy and translate any language you want with text translator, voice translator, photo translator,... Our all-language interpreter &amp; translator tools allow you to do an offline translation even if you have no internet connection...<br><br><b>\ud83c\udf10Main feature of Language Translator, Translate\ud83c\udf10</b><br><b>\u2600\ufe0fDeep translate\u2600\ufe0f</b><br>\u2714 Fast, and easy translations between the following languages are supported: translate English to Hindi, Tagalog, Spanish, Arabic, Japanese, Korean, Chinese, German, French, Italian, Dutch, etc. The Language Translator app has +100 languages for your daily translate needs.<br><br><b>\ud83d\udccbChat, Text Translator</b><br>\u2714 Quick text translate on screen: this function is ready with a tap screen to translate the text you want.<br>\u2714 Chat translator: Translate all messages that have come to you with an instant language translator. Just click on messages, copy a text, and auto-translate from chat, website with language tool<br><br><b>\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udde8\ufe0fPhoto translator</b><br>\u2714 Turn your camera into an instant online translator. Take a photo and easily translate images with one tap. Translation text will be rendered directly in the photo with the live camera and image translator feature. Photo translation of the object will allow you to understand everything you see.<br>\u2714 Your trusted document translator: Point your camera at a document and get instant translation with image translator.<br><br><b>\ud83d\udce2Voice translator</b><br>\u2714 Become your interpreter to help record sound to transcribe speech to text. Voice-to-voice real time translation is the ideal feature to help you communicate with people around the world or travel, simply talk and Language Translator app will translate for you. Accurate translation of conversation, dialog, etc.<br>\u2714 Text to speech of the voice translator allows you to understand everything you hear.<br><br><b>\u2600\ufe0fLearn all languages\u2600\ufe0f</b><br>\u2714 Learn multiple languages with this language exchange app: quickly improve vocabulary with this Language Translator - Translate app, which allows easy translation of all languages in parallel and offers English idioms, new phrases, and over 200 topic recognitions, along with vocabulary and sentence exercises for deep memorization and skill enhancement.<br><br>Note<br>In instant translator mode, app use Accessibility Service to be able to get screen text.<br><br>Contact us: teammarketing@lutech.ltd",
